  "body": "\r\n<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at 80c3ace375d519942ed2273c297908b26e89bb28 -->\r\n\r\n## What's Changed\r\n### Changes\r\n* fix yaml parser, stream mode parity with jq, SIGPIPE handling, version bump by @JFryy in https://github.com/JFryy/qq/pull/48\r\n* Add fix for integer float conversion with toml codec by @JFryy in https://github.com/JFryy/qq/pull/51\r\n* Derive version from git tag and automate releases by @JFryy in https://github.com/JFryy/qq/pull/64\r\n### Dependencies\r\n* Bump google.golang.org/grpc from 1.79.1 to 1.79.3 in the go_modules group across 1 directory by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/JFryy/qq/pull/45\r\n* Bump github.com/apache/thrift from 0.22.0 to 0.23.0 in the go_modules group across 1 directory by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/JFryy/qq/pull/49\r\n* Bump the go_modules group across 1 directory with 2 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/JFryy/qq/pull/58\r\n* Bump google.golang.org/grpc from 1.82.1 to 1.83.1 in the go_modules group across 1 directory by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/JFryy/qq/pull/62\r\n* Bump github.com/apache/thrift from 0.23.0 to 0.24.0 in the go_modules group across 1 directory by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/JFryy/qq/pull/63\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @dependabot[bot] made their first contribution in https://github.com/JFryy/qq/pull/45\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/JFryy/qq/compare/v0.3.4...v0.4.0\r\n\r\n",
  "mentions_count": 2
}
